    {
      "source": "Descriptor for a property-level type along its potential projection that is held within a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a>-like\nor <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>-like container. Property paths within containers use the deeply unwrapped actual type of the\ncontainer as root type and as they cannot be tied immediately to the root entity.",
      "translation": "用于描述在类似<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Collection.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Collection</code></a>或类似<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>容器内持有的属性级类型的潜在投影的元数据。容器内的属性路径以容器的深度解包后的实际类型作为根类型，且由于无法立即将其与根实体关联，因此具有特殊性。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
